<title>USA: Golden Star pleased with Paul Isnard results.</title>
<headline>Golden Star pleased with Paul Isnard results.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Star Resources Ltd said its about 70 percent owned French subsidiary, Guyanor Ressources SA, is pleased with the results of its initial drilling campaign at the Montagne d'Or target on the Paul Isnard project in French Guiana.</p>
<p>Guyanor has a 75 percent interest in the project area, which includes the Paul Isnard and Eau Blanche projects covering 250 square kilometers, while LaSource Developpement SAS holds the remaining 25 percent. It is a French subsidiary of the LaSource Group.</p>
</text>
